          "author": "Ladybird",
          "description": "Brought to you by Ladybird.  \n\nA heart-warming collection of original audio stories celebrating Christmas.  Join the festive fun and discover the joy of kindness, togetherness and giving in five magical new stories! These uplifting stories are perfect for young children celebrating Christmas with their friends and family, or for those who love sharing in the wonder and traditions of the festive season.  \n\n\n\nThese stories are aimed at children aged three to six for family listening, learning and the development of young minds.  \n\n\n\nOther audiobooks in the Ladybird Audio Original series include Ladybird Advent Stories, Ladybird Funny Nativity Play and the Ladybird Audio Adventures series.",
